# Import / publish / merge system rules (КРУГИ)

Standing gates from the Jul 2026 backlog — do not re-introduce one-off workarounds.

## Merge (R01)
- Fill-empty / union only; never overwrite non-empty keep fields (including `image_url`).
- Catalog donor is **destroyed** after merge (hard delete); archive only if FK blocks delete.
- Merge never auto-publishes — archived → `pending` at most; Approve is separate.
- Queue twins stay `status=duplicate`.

## Enrich SaaS (R02 / R08)
- `PLATFORM_SAAS_HOSTS` / `isPlatformSaasHost`: dikidi, glossgenius, fresha, vagaro, booksy, calendly, …
- SaaS URL → `booking_url` only; never card `website` / platform phone / `@dikidi.` email / platform IG.
- Keep TS (`lib/import-review/platform-saas-hosts.ts`) and Python (`scripts/business-enrich/platform_saas_hosts.py`) in sync.

## Street + geo (R03 / R04)
- No street → not `businesses` (specialist or skip). Enforce on approve **and** autopublish.
- Never default `city` / service_area to `"Orange County"`.

## Recommendations (R05)
- Third-party reco without self-offer → attach/suspect only; do not create new approved entity.

## Events (R06 / R07)
- `purge_past_events(10, 30)` in `run_scheduled_maintenance`.
- Multi-date posts: split to N events or block approve until structured.

## Categories (R09 / R10)
- Ban publish with `pro_other` / missing professional category.
- `celebrations` / `party_planning` → business|specialist by street, never affiche `events` table.
- `category=events` → affiche only with date signal.

## Content (R12 / R13)
- Approve runs `redactContactsFromPublicText` on description.
- News / office-move → updates via `isNewsUpdateTitle`, never services.

# Thin / visual pro clones (Ілля×2, Оля×2, Юля×2)
- Weak first-name cards need phone|IG|website|email — Telegram post URL alone is not enough (`lib/professional/thin-card-policy.ts`).
- Same normalized display_name already approved → block publish (merge instead).
- Cleanup: `scripts/business-enrich/collapse_thin_professional_dups.py --region oc --apply`.

